<title>USA: Roberds April same-store sales dropped.</title>
<headline>Roberds April same-store sales dropped.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberds Inc reported sales for the month of April and first four months of the year.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$25.8	$24.0	+7.6	-15.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $108.9	$94.6     +15.1	-10.9</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
